LibreDDColor third-party attribution
====================================

Scope
-----

This directory contains an inference-only PyTorch adaptation of DDColor's
ConvNeXt encoder, wide UNet decoder, multi-scale color transformer, and Lab
colorization pipeline. Module and parameter names remain compatible with the
official checkpoints. LibreYOLO modifications include static channel
bookkeeping at construction, family/config wiring, safe checkpoint conversion,
and the RGB ``Results.restored`` contract.

No training code, private data, historical-photo demo image, or unrelated
ColorFormer/DFDNet component is included.

